{"title":"Ratch","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Ratch is a named <a href=\"#/monster/goblin\">Goblin</a> seen at level 13 (warrior).</p>\n      <h2>Wearing</h2><p></p><div class=\"gear-line\"><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>head</i> Iron Spikedhelm</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>main hand</i> Iron Warmace</span></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find Ratch</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>Rustpick Mine</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 2×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-1000044143\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"ratch\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"shaft-iron\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/81185423ec7184650576.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Shaft Iron</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">4 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"iron-spear\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f2ba60fdbdafb2887936.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Iron Spear</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1 drop</span></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Other named Goblins</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/goblin-miner\">Goblin Miner</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/goblin-brute\">Goblin Brute</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/goblin-mage\">Goblin Mage</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/goblin-shaman\">Goblin Shaman</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/goblin-king\">Goblin King</a> · <a href=\"#/npc/nib-the-toolkeeper\">Nib the Toolkeeper</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/01c7bb9084aed395fe94.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>Ratch</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/goblin\">Goblin</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>13</td></tr><tr><th>Class</th><td>warrior</td></tr>\n    